  doc=detectMismatch is the deterministic detector (req.6.2): error/exit-code/HTTP-\nstatus/empty/JSON-parse shapes decide without a model call. Returns\n(mismatch, decided); undecided outcomes fall to the cheap-model comparator.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/agent/prediction.go

