NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/agent.overflowStore kind=type
  digest=b3:2ebdd641d9975fb3d35f90f315860d26872492a7e2343c6f67b26cc7ebcb8650 file=neo/internal/agent/overflow.go range=48:58 lang=go exported=false byte_range=1901:2336
  sig=type overflowStore struct {\n	mu	sync.Mutex\n	dir	string\n	seq	int\n	entries	map[string]*ovfEntry\n}
  doc=overflowStore persists oversized tool results to a run-scoped temp directory\nand serves bounded windows of them back. It is created lazily on the first\noverflow and removed wholesale at turn end (cleanup). All methods are\ngoroutine-safe: capping and read_overflow can both run from the concurrent\ndispatch path.
