  sig=func overlapPct(a, b map[string]struct{}) int
  doc=overlapPct is the overlap coefficient (|a∩b| / min(|a|,|b|)) as a percentage.\nTwo empty word sets count as fully overlapping (identical word-free op); a\nnon-empty vs empty pair counts as no overlap.
