  digest=b3:099af2f20c9f66e594c7048b9f833b227ae041999dcbb1388270b1893b19084d file=neo/internal/agent/prediction.go range=82:119 lang=go exported=false byte_range=3114:4559
  sig=func probeStrategy(name string, args map[string]interface{}) (string, bool)
  doc=probeStrategy classifies a tool call as probe-class and returns its strategy\nkey. The key deliberately IGNORES the varying argument (the guessed path,\nthe reworded query) and keeps the invariant part (tool + host / command\nhead), so differently-argued guesses of one strategy meter together.
